11. Data that is not redistributed
==========================================================================

  - MPAS-Data physics tables (github.com/MPAS-Dev/MPAS-Data, tag v8.2,
    commit c57dbc7be629802c6e848770a9e44b9bc602be41: the RRTMG, CAM, Noah,
